  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposal, by reason of its inappropriate position, design and materials, and its excessive size and scale, would result in a bulky and incongruous addition to the main building, which would harm the character and appearance of the site, street scene and Isleworth Riverside Conservation Area, contrary to Local Plan Policies CC1, CC2 and CC4.",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposal, by reason of its inappropriate position, and its excessive size and scale, would result in the permanent enclosure of a significant area of public highway, obstructing pedestrian movements and creating blind corners, which would reduce pedestrian comfort along this section of Spur Road and London Road, contrary to Policy EC2 of the Local Plan."
